    "Proliferate",
    "Combat damage",
    "Legends"
  ],
  "strategy": "Tidus, Yuna's Guardian moves a counter between your creatures at the start of each combat and, once a turn, draws a card and proliferates when creatures with counters connect. The deck exists to put counters everywhere and keep growing them: Hardened Scales adds one to every placement, Generous Patron, Duskshell Crawler and Together Forever spread +1/+1 counters, and Grateful Apparition, Tromell, Seymour's Butler and Tidus himself proliferate them. Yuna, Grand Summoner makes the next creature enter bigger and turns any countered permanent's death into counters elsewhere, while Forgotten Ancient, Resourceful Defense and Sin, Unending Cataclysm move what the board has already built. Inspiring Call and Bred for the Hunt draw off the counters, Walking Ballista spends them as damage, and Damning Verdict, Farewell and Path to Exile clear everything that has none.",
